{
  "_readme": [
    "Special chars use JSON escapes:",
    "  \\n     = new line",
    "  \\t     = tab",
    "  \\b     = backspace",
    "  \\uXXXX = Unicode char.",
    "  \\\"    = literal quote",
    "  \\\\    = literal backslash",
    "Sender key tokens (keystroke mode only):",
    "  {Enter}",
    "  {Tab}",
    "  {Backspace}",
    "  {Space}",
    "  {Left}",
    "  {Right}",
    "  {Up}",
    "  {Down}",
    "Literal braces:",
    "  {{} = {",
    "  {}} = }",
    "Legacy escapes:",
    "  {!}",
    "  {#}",
    "  {@}",
    "  {+}",
    "  {^}",
    "Clipboard-send mode (the circle, top-left):",
    "  \\n and \\t paste as real characters and won't submit a chat box;",
    "  the {..} key tokens only work in keystroke mode.",
    "Per-button fields:",
    "  text",
    "  secret",
    "  desc",
    "  hotkey",
    "  width",
    "  align",
    "  showText",
    "  tipText",
    "  gapBefore (cells of empty space before this button; fractional ok)",
    "  blank (true = an empty spacer cell; text/hotkey/desc are ignored).",
    "Row fields:",
    "  gapBefore (rows of empty space before this row; fractional ok)",
    "  indent (empty cells before the first button)",
    "  blank (true = an empty spacer row).",
    "Per-tab fields:",
    "  name",
    "  columns",
    "  fontSize",
    "  fontName",
    "  buttonWidth",
    "  buttonHeight",
    "  gap",
    "A code tab is:",
    "  {\"builtin\": \"Emojis\"}",
    "secret:",
    "  an encrypted value;",
    "  type the plaintext once and it is sealed on the next load.",
    "Sharing across machines: use the menu's Export / Import - Import merges (per tab/button, newest wins) so neither machine's edits are clobbered.",
    "Each tab/button has an app-managed id and mod for that merge - don't edit those.",
    "This _readme is ignored by the app - edit or delete it freely."
